WEBVTT

00:00:11.843 --> 00:00:14.888
Johnny, we need
the most brain-dominating,

00:00:14.971 --> 00:00:18.474
toe-tappinating song
in the history of all the universe.

00:00:22.145 --> 00:00:24.647
Come on. Where is it?

00:00:26.858 --> 00:00:28.109
I don't know!

00:00:28.902 --> 00:00:30.236
There's too many choices.

00:00:33.573 --> 00:00:34.824
No, wait!

00:00:35.366 --> 00:00:37.994
This is it.

00:00:50.715 --> 00:00:51.758
What the...

00:01:06.606 --> 00:01:08.441
Boy, that stinks.

00:01:14.656 --> 00:01:16.032
It's working!

00:01:23.748 --> 00:01:28.419
Hey, Johnny's corny music
is defeating the evil music.

00:01:28.711 --> 00:01:29.963
I kind of like it.

00:01:52.527 --> 00:01:53.820
No!

00:02:16.968 --> 00:02:20.013
I'm a slave to the rhythm!

00:02:26.269 --> 00:02:27.270
No!

00:02:29.731 --> 00:02:31.357
Drac, what are you doing?

00:02:31.649 --> 00:02:33.526
You got to be greater than the haters!

00:02:49.542 --> 00:02:50.543
Why?

00:02:50.626 --> 00:02:52.837
Why, after everything,

00:02:53.504 --> 00:02:55.548
would you save my life?

00:02:55.673 --> 00:02:58.718
Because basically we are all the same.

00:02:59.218 --> 00:03:02.513
Claws or hands, two eyes or three eyes.

00:03:02.597 --> 00:03:04.557
-Green skin.
-No skin.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.059
-Prickly.
-Brainy.

00:03:11.856 --> 00:03:13.232
I'm sorry.

00:03:22.158 --> 00:03:24.243
You are amazing.

00:03:35.046 --> 00:03:37.507
Look at me, Dennis. Look at me.

00:03:38.883 --> 00:03:40.927
Come on, you can't deny it.

00:03:41.594 --> 00:03:43.679
No! I'm too young to Zing!

00:03:48.601 --> 00:03:50.561
Well, I feel kind of silly now.

00:03:51.479 --> 00:03:54.107
For decades I have hunted your kind,

00:03:54.649 --> 00:03:56.109
persecuted you.

00:03:59.445 --> 00:04:02.448
The only thing I can do
to make it up to you is

00:04:03.741 --> 00:04:05.034
give you

00:04:06.452 --> 00:04:08.204
a 30% refund.

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.748
Preposterous!

00:04:12.291 --> 00:04:13.668
All right.

00:04:14.085 --> 00:04:15.128
Full refund.

00:04:45.825 --> 00:04:48.661
Wayne, Wanda, what happened to you guys?

00:04:48.744 --> 00:04:51.205
Yeah, we, like,
hardly saw you on the cruise.

00:04:51.414 --> 00:04:52.415
Yeah, I know.

00:04:52.498 --> 00:04:55.376
We got tranquilized and spent
most of the trip locked in a closet.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.462
We're gonna book it again
for the holidays.

00:05:04.468 --> 00:05:05.761
Hi. Checking in?

00:05:05.845 --> 00:05:07.555
Yes. Thank you.

00:05:07.763 --> 00:05:09.849
Great. I have a room all ready for you.

00:05:11.517 --> 00:05:13.436
Hey, buddy, would you mind?

00:05:13.853 --> 00:05:14.979
Sure thing, pal.

00:05:31.204 --> 00:05:34.457
Okay, what's going on, sneaky pants?

00:05:35.041 --> 00:05:36.292
Nothing.

00:05:36.751 --> 00:05:40.963
It's just, I wanted to make sure
nobody would bother us.

00:05:42.215 --> 00:05:43.216
Why?

00:05:43.299 --> 00:05:45.009
Are you going to suck-a my blood?
Bleh, bleh-bleh.

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:49.096
No.

00:05:49.764 --> 00:05:51.766
I was going to ask you

00:05:52.558 --> 00:05:54.143
if you would marry me.

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:00.650
Well? What do you say?

00:06:01.359 --> 00:06:02.777
Will you marry me?

00:06:06.364 --> 00:06:08.658
I... I...

00:06:12.912 --> 00:06:13.955
Wha...

00:06:16.875 --> 00:06:18.903
I mean, I woobee doobeedee?

00:06:22.797 --> 00:06:24.507
What did she say?

00:06:26.425 --> 00:06:27.677
I'm not sure.

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:32.139
Yes!

